[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3524007342","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640#issuecomment-3524007342","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640","id":3524007342,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SDBWu","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T21:30:00Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T21:30:00Z","body":"> Testing revealed that Android devices with Adreno 5XX GPUs (confirmed on Android 9 and 10, other versions unknown) experience application crashes when scenes containing shaders become invisible relative to the screen (e.g., when the UI is occluded or the app is backgrounded).\r\n\r\nCould you also provide a `Minimal Reproduction Project (MRP)` for this?\r\n\r\nThere are several Adreno 5xx devices on the Firebase Test Lab; I would like to test this PR there as well.\r\n\r\n- Galaxy A02s, Adreno (TM) 506, Android 12\r\n- Galaxy Tab S3, Adreno (TM) 530, Android 9\r\n- AQUOS sense2 SH-01L, Adreno (TM) 506, Android 9\r\n- F-01L, Adreno (TM) 506, Android 8.1  \r\n\r\n\r\nNotice `F-01L`: We are aware of several Vulkan crashes, this device did not appear to be affected.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n----------\r\n\r\n[Docs Build.HARDWARE](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/os/Build#HARDWARE)\r\n> The name of the hardware (from the kernel command line or /proc).\r\n\r\nWe should also test this part to see if it's necessary. `FileReader(\"/proc/cpuinfo\")`\r\nHave you only tested it on two devices running Android 9 and 10?\r\n\r\n```kotlin\r\n\t\t// Also check for Snapdragon 6XX series on Android 9 and below\r\n\t\t// as these often have Adreno 5XX GPUs with similar issues\r\n\t\tif (!isProblematicSoc && Build.VERSION.SDK_INT <= Build.VERSION_CODES.P) {\r\n\t\t\ttry {\r\n\t\t\t\tBufferedReader(FileReader(\"/proc/cpuinfo\")).use { reader ->\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3524007342/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3525081854","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640#issuecomment-3525081854","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640","id":3525081854,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SHHr-","user":{"login":"VivianZhoulw","id":11807640,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODA3NjQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11807640?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw","html_url":"https://github.com/VivianZhoulw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-13T03:30:08Z","updated_at":"2025-11-13T03:30:08Z","body":"This is the minimal reproducible code that causes a crash. It crashes immediately when opened on Redmi Note 5 (GPU Adreno 506) running Android 9.\r\n[test-shader.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23515208/test-shader.zip)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3525081854/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529736659","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640#issuecomment-3529736659","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640","id":3529736659,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SY4HT","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-13T21:13:41Z","updated_at":"2025-11-13T21:13:41Z","body":"> This is the minimal reproducible code that causes a crash. It crashes immediately when opened on Redmi Note 5 (GPU Adreno 506) running Android 9.\r\n> [test-shader.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23515208/test-shader.zip)\r\n\r\n> crashes on Adreno 5XX GPUs when scenes become occluded\r\n> experience application crashes when scenes containing shaders become invisible relative to the screen (e.g., when the UI is occluded or the app is backgrounded).\r\n\r\n\r\nI think it's a `uniform` shader crash. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/79760, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/82602, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/85097, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86037\r\n\r\n@clayjohn What do you think about this PR? **Fallback to OpenGLES**.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92611#issuecomment-3422846210\r\n> My suggestion to start with would be that we drop support for Adreno 3xx and 5xx using Vulkan. We don't really have the resources to properly adapt our Vulkan renderer to be guaranteed to work on those devices\r\n\r\nIf this PR has a chance, then I'll continue testing. \r\nPerhaps we can expand the list later to include more GPUs that have problems with Vulkan.\r\n\r\n\r\n------------------\r\n\r\nI modified gdshader and it worked on all 4 Adreno 5xx devices on Firebase Test Lab. \r\n(`v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]`)\r\n\r\n```glsl\r\n//uniform float alpha;\r\nconst float alpha = 1.0;\r\n//uniform vec2 size;\r\nconst vec2 size = vec2(0.0, 0.0);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere is one more workaround: place the node with a uniform shader into a `CanvasGroup`. \r\n_(Or render the uniform shader only at the very end, place the node at the bottom of the tree; this also prevents the crash.)_\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529736659/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537215648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640#issuecomment-3537215648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640","id":3537215648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S1aCg","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T00:50:42Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T00:50:42Z","body":"[platform/android/java/lib/src/main/java/org/godotengine/godot/utils/DeviceUtils.kt](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640/files#diff-5869b49dae05a634b6da8ca4c1060a0fb804992ca6399bb31f4fa79f84b37404)\r\n\r\n\r\nThis file was deleted in this PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111870/files\r\n\r\nIf your PR is accepted, we wi