"@AllenDang We'll get to this PR, but we're a bit busy right now. I'm trying to finish my feature PRs before feature freeze, and this bug fix can be merged after that anyway. m4gr3d also seems busy with XR stuff right now.\r\n\r\nFor now, please wait for input from either m4gr3d or clayjohn.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3563283863/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3563381163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640#issuecomment-3563381163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640","id":3563381163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UZOGr","user":{"login":"AllenDang","id":18550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-21T15:01:19Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T15:01:19Z","body":"@syntaxerror247 Thanks, I'll wait.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3563381163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3578741321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640#issuecomment-3578741321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640","id":3578741321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VT0JJ","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T03:01:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T03:01:57Z","body":"> * Vulkan path: Force fallback to OpenGL3 rendering for Adreno 5XX GPUs, as these devices have critical Vulkan driver bugs that cause crashes in FinalizeDescriptors when handling descriptor sets for occluded UI elements.\r\n\r\nFalling back to OpenGL is a complex feature on mobile, so I expect this PR to get thorough review by the rendering team if we want to update that behavior.\r\n\r\nRegardless, the approach currently used is not the right one. Instead if we were to make the change, you would update [`Godot#meetsVulkanRequirements(...)`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9dd6c4dbac70b28e8156255c3a2b78722772b036/platform/android/java/lib/src/main/java/org/godotengine/godot/Godot.kt#L958) so that it returns `false` for the problematic mobile gpus.\r\n\r\nThis would cause the [render init logic](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9dd6c4dbac70b28e8156255c3a2b78722772b036/platform/android/java/lib/src/main/java/org/godotengine/godot/Godot.kt#L563-L571) to check whether `rendering/rendering_device/fallback_to_opengl3` is enabled, and use the opengl renderer if so.\r\n\r\ncc @clayjohn ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3578741321/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3578745941","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640#issuecomment-3578745941","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640","id":3578745941,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VT1RV","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T03:03:08Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T03:03:08Z","body":"> * OpenGL ES path: Disable EGL context preservation for Adreno 5XX GPUs to force full context recreation, preventing shader object corruption.\r\n> * Vulkan thread: Force thread restart on surface loss for problematic Adreno GPUs to ensure clean state recovery.\r\n\r\nWe'll need to validate these don't introduce regressions on non-problematic GPUs. Were you able to check that?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3578745941/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716659557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640#issuecomment-3716659557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640","id":3716659557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dh7ll","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T22:58:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T22:58:24Z","body":"This PR should no longer be necessary.\r\n\r\n\r\nThere is a PR that fixes many Adreno 5xx issues with Vulkan: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114416","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716659557/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716662591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640#issuecomment-3716662591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640","id":3716662591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dh8U_","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T22:59:59Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T23:00:10Z","body":"Indeed, superseded by #114416. Thanks for the contribution!","author_assoc